```sql
BEGIN;
INSERT INTO outer ...;
SAVEPOINT inner;
INSERT INTO middle ...;
  SAVEPOINT inner2;
  INSERT INTO leaf ...;
  ROLLBACK TO inner2; -- undo leaf insert
RELEASE inner; -- commit middle
COMMIT; -- commit outer
```. ROLLBACK TO doesn't end transaction — continues. RELEASE merges savepoint into parent. Use case: partial undo in long transactions.

