Pattern: ```sql
PRAGMA user_version;  -- returns current version (default 0)
BEGIN;
ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN bio TEXT;
PRAGMA user_version = 2;
COMMIT;
```. App reads version on startup + applies migrations in order. For complex changes (drop column pre-3.35, change CHECK): 12-step recreate-table process. Tools: golang-migrate, alembic (SQLAlchemy), Atlas, sqlite-utils.

