entries.statement:
On every connection: ```sql
PRAGMA journal_mode = WAL;
PRAGMA synchronous = NORMAL;
PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;
PRAGMA busy_timeout = 5000;
PRAGMA cache_size = -64000;
PRAGMA temp_store = MEMORY;
```. Daily: `PRAGMA optimize;` (3.18+ — incremental stats update). Weekly: `PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE);` (keeps WAL bounded). Monthly: `VACUUM;` (if heavy DELETEs) or `VACUUM INTO 'compact.db';` for online compaction.

